unction `get_unicode_length_of_utf8` iterates through each byte of the input UTF-8 string and increments a counter for every byte processed. It handles multi-byte UTF-8 sequences by reading additional bytes as needed but doesn't combine them into Unicode code points, instead returning the total number of bytes in the UTF-8 encoded data.\n\n**Summary:** The function counts the total number of bytes in the given UTF-8 string, considering each byte individually regardless of whether it belongs to a multi-byte character.",
