length of the string and constructs the hash by shifting and adding each character, then returns this value modulo a predefined size.\n\n**Final Answer:** The function computes a hash of the given string by processing each character with left shifts and additions, then returns the result modulo a specific size, intended for use in hashing strings within a table.",
