 function `java_lang_StringBuffer_toString` converts a `Java.Lang.StringBuffer` object into a `Java.Lang.String` object. It retrieves the content and length of the buffer, packs the UTF-8 encoded characters into a byte array, looks up this string in a pool, and returns it as a Java string.\n\n**Summary:** Converts `StringBuffer` contents to a String.",
