 their internal arrays.\n</think>\n\nThe function `java_lang_String_equals` implements the equals method for Java String objects. It checks if two String instances are equal by first comparing object references, then string lengths, and finally each character in the strings to ensure they match completely.\n\n**Answer:**\nThis function checks if two String objects are equal by comparing their references, lengths, and corresponding characters.",
