k>\n\nThe function dynamically allocates memory for a new Java object based on the given class, initializes the memory block, and sets header information to indicate the object's type. It creates an instance of a Java object with specified size.\n\n**Function Purpose:**\nAllocates and initializes a new Java object instance of a specified class, setting its header to indicate it is a Java object.",
