l it becomes zero, counting how many shifts occur. This count corresponds to the exponent in the largest power of two that is not greater than `scale`.\n\nThe summary is:\n\n**Summary:** The function computes the highest power of two less than or equal to `scale` and returns its logarithm base 2 value (the exponent).",
