f the method is called from jitted code, it wraps it appropriately for use in that context.\n\nFunction Lookup Native Entry",
      "summary": "<think>\nThe function generates native code that wraps a Java method for use in native contexts, handling different data types and static/non-static methods by managing stack operations.\n\n**Summary:** The function `generate_java_to_native_wrapper` converts a Java method into native C/C++ code to allow its execution from native environments, managing argument handling and static method resolution."
